            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/true"} truth
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/false"} falsity
            are continuously connected in such toposes and blend into each other, endowing (the logic in)
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi ℰ
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{E}
            with a certain
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hegel"} Hegelian
