          %p
            Directly related to this distributivity property is the question when a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/variety"} variety
            of algebras has a subobject classifier (cf. Johnstone
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#JT90"} 1990
          %h2#generalizations Generalizations
          %h3#weak_subobject_classifier Weak subobject classifier
          %p
